elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯上线AI创作撮合平台「企鹅微单」，支持需求发布、智能匹配与微信内结算</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">亚马逊拟以70亿美元收购AI初创公司Decart，布局跨芯片适配技术</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI将GPT-6.1 Sol默认上下文扩容至500k并取消长文本额外收费</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁集团AI产品“灵光”开启新版内测，全面对标Meta Muse升级智能体</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6d785d4bd20eee7402573734c0cc7791.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁集团旗下AI产品“灵光”近日开启新版本小范围内测，全面对标Meta于今年9月发布的个人智能体Muse。该项目筹备半年，计划于本月全面开放。此次升级核心在于从基础AI助手向具备长期记忆、可主动推进复杂任务的AI原生个人智能体跨越。新版本通过调用Skill和MCP协议，实现了钉钉发信息、控制智能家居等跨应用操作。内测用例聚焦长程、多变量场景，包括追踪市场异动、协助家长管理钉钉打卡，以及在航班延误或景区限流时自动重排旅行路线。此次迭代标志着国内大厂正加速布局主动式AI智能体，推动应用向全流程任务托管深度演进，为用户提供更具自主性的智能化服务。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果将于10月13日发布HomeView中枢并联合LG开发智能家居硬件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/21b4950880151a7a617ad647002b3a2b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果计划于10月13日发布新一代智能家居产品，包括搭载A18芯片的智能家居中枢HomeView、搭载S10芯片的HomePod mini及搭载A19芯片的Apple TV。HomeView提供桌面与壁挂两种版本，预计11月中旬上市，其余两款产品将于10月30日开售。HomeView配备显示屏，定位为家庭智能设备的集中控制中枢。此外，苹果正与LG电子合作开发智能门铃、门锁、恒温器及安防摄像头等设备，将以“Apple Home Collection”品牌推出，预计最早于2026年晚些时候上市。此次布局旨在通过家庭控制中枢与配套硬件强化生态联动，进一步拓展智能家居硬件矩阵。目前相关产品规格、售价及具体上市安排仍待苹果官方确认。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯上线AI创作撮合平台「企鹅微单」，支持需求发布、智能匹配与微信内结算</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/aa020c7c8eb55b3d8807dd2605a9dccf.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯近期在微信生态内正式上线创作撮合平台「企鹅微单」，旨在连接AI创作需求方与具备AI制图、视频剪辑能力的创作者。该平台目前处于早期开放阶段，主要服务于电商商家、短视频团队等需求方，以及掌握AI工具的手艺人。平台内置AI助手协助梳理创作需求，通过需求发布、智能匹配、三方群组沟通、下单付款及验收结算的完整链路，实现交易闭环。手艺人需通过客服渠道提交申请并经审核后入驻。企鹅微单通过标准化交易流程，将分散的AI创作者接入商业化链路，旨在解决AI创作工具变现难的问题。后续平台能否形成稳定的供给与复购，将取决于其定价机制、交付标准及结算规则的进一步完善。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亚马逊拟以70亿美元收购AI初创公司Decart，布局跨芯片适配技术</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d8495333cc73fd708a9f4b2acf78a186.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亚马逊正与AI初创公司Decart商谈收购事宜，交易潜在估值约为70亿美元。Decart的核心技术在于跨芯片适配软件，该软件充当“万能转接头”，旨在解决AI模型在不同品牌芯片间迁移时的底层适配难题，实现工作负载（workload）的灵活调度。此前，Anthropic曾于今年8月以约60亿美元报价洽购Decart，但于9月退出谈判。Decart此前已累计融资超4亿美元，今年5月估值近40亿美元。对于以云服务和算力为核心业务的亚马逊而言，此举意在通过底层技术打破芯片厂商的生态壁垒，提升其云平台对客户的吸引力，确保模型在不同硬件环境下的无缝运行，从而进一步巩固其在AI基础设施领域的竞争优势。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI将GPT-6.1 Sol默认上下文扩容至500k并取消长文本额外收费</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/71193de35e82f8b642dbd82dd58f1caf.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI工程师Thibault Sottiaux宣布，GPT-6.1 Sol模型在Codex与Work环境下的默认上下文长度已从272k tokens提升至500k，增幅约80%。此次升级旨在提升模型处理长篇报告、大型代码库及复杂多轮对话的能力，减少自动压缩带来的信息丢失。除默认窗口扩容外，用户仍可手动将上下文上限调节至1M。配合此次调整，OpenAI宣布不再对长上下文功能收取额外费用，变相降低了重度使用者的成本门槛。官方表示，500k是平衡性能与体验的“甜点区”。这一举措直接优化了长程记忆任务的交互体验，在当前大模型窗口竞争激烈的背景下，通过免除附加费进一步强化了GPT-6.1 Sol的市场竞争力。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
